# Allowlist: exclude everything, then permit only the paths that the COPY
# lines of the Dockerfile read. Secrets and state (.env, data/, .local/) and
# the Git metadata never reach the builder. Update this list together with
# the COPY lines. See docs/image.md.
*

!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!setup.py
!README.md
!scripts/build_support/
!bot/
!crates/
!openviking/
!openviking_cli/
!openviking_gateway/
!src/
!third_party/
!web-studio/
!deploy/docker/openviking-entrypoint.sh
!deploy/docker/pending_health_server.py

# Local development artifacts inside the permitted paths (the upstream list,
# made to match at every depth).
**/.env*
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/target/
**/node_modules
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
src/build/
web-studio/dist
web-studio/.vite
openviking/web_studio/dist
